  The reel_script says the accident happened 'near Vellithirupur' (வெள்ளித்திருப்பூர் அருகே) in a sentence describing the victim's residence, mixing the place of the accident/residence; more importantly the reel_script states 'வெள்ளித்திருப்பூர் அருகேயுள்ள முரளி குடியிருப்பைச் சேர்ந்த சத்யா' which is accurate, but the slides_spec line 'சம்பவ இடத்திலேயே' and the reel phrase 'மோதிய வேகத்தில்' are not in the article
  The reel_script says the victim is 'பெண் தொழிலாளி' and gives her age as 45 in the same sentence as her occupation, which is accurate, but the sentence 'சத்யா, 45 வயது கூலித் தொழிலாளி' is a grammatically awkward construction with the age attached to the occupation, not clearly stating she is the person described
